 that $A$ has $3$ pivots in the $1$st, $2$nd and $4$th columns:\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 & 5 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTherefore, the only non-pivot column is the $3$rd column."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186342035 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186124478 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "a5f0d2e9-1cf6-5fe4-85cc-f401382f39b2" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Non-Pivot Columns of a Matrix in Row Echelon Form"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1d67e28c-a256-5a1d-9e04-f477d00894a8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$5$th only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339387} {:answer/id #uuid "260f4b80-53d9-5f26-b97b-2b2e97e88497" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$3$rd, $4$th, and $5$th only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339456} {:answer/id #uuid "2def53e1-c883-56b0-9c46-4ebe4d3dbc36" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$2$nd, $3$rd, and $5$th only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339534} {:answer/id #uuid "6092a204-0ea0-56e8-9213-ebd6bcdfacc1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$3$rd only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339988} {:answer/id #uuid "d76a0d0f-e606-54f1-91c8-3c6c587ad587" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$3$rd and $5$th only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341037}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d76a0d0f-e606-54f1-91c8-3c6c587ad587" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$3$rd and $5$th only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341037} :answer-field/id #uuid "72bbb48e-fe4e-545a-9b68-754256645b24" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341579}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 1759218